<</S/Figure/Pg 379 0 R/P 1624 0 R/K 553/Alt(þÿ\000G\000r\000a\000p\000h\000 \000o\000f\000 \000a\000 \000s\000y\000s\000t\000e\000m\000 \000o\000f\000 \0002\000 \000l\000i\000n\000e\000s\000 \000a\000n\000d\000 \000a\000 \000p\000a\000r\000a\000b\000o\000l\000a\000 \000i\000n\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000x\000 \000y\000 \000p\000l\000a\000n\000e\000 \000w\000i\000t\000h\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000o\000r\000i\000g\000i\000n\000 \000l\000a\000b\000e\000l\000e\000d\000 \000O\000.\000 \000T\000h\000e\000 \000x\000 \000a\000x\000i\000s\000 \000r\000a\000n\000g\000e\000s\000 \000f\000r\000o\000m\000 \000n\000e\000g\000a\000t\000i\000v\000e\000 \0005\000 \000t\000o\000 \0005\000.\000 \000T\000h\000e\000 \000y\000 \000a\000x\000i\000s\000 \000r\000a\000n\000g\000e\000s\000 \000f\000r\000o\000m\000 \000n\000e\000g\000a\000t\000i\000v\000e\000 \0008\000 \000t\000o\000 \0008\000.\000 \000\r "\000\011\000F\000o\000r\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000f\000i\000r\000s\000t\000 \000l\000i\000n\000e\000 \000i\000n\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000s\000y\000s\000t\000e\000m\000:\000\r "\000\011\000T\000h\000e\000 \000l\000i\000n\000e\000 \000s\000l\000a\000n\000t\000s\000 \000s\000h\000a\000r\000p\000l\000y\000 \000d\000o\000w\000n\000 \000f\000r\000o\000m\000 \000l\000e\000f\000t\000 \000t\000o\000 \000r\000i\000g\000h\000t\000.\000\r "\000\011\000T\000h\000e\000 \000l\000i\000n\000e\000 \000p\000a\000s\000s\000e\000s\000 \000t\000h\000r\000o\000u\000g\000h\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000f\000o\000l\000l\000o\000w\000i\000n\000g\000 \000p\000o\000i\000n\000t\000s\000:\000\r "\000\011\000\(\0000\000 \000c\000o\000m\000m\000a\000 \0003\000\)\000\r "\000\011\000\(\000t\000h\000r\000e\000e\000 \000h\000a\000l\000v\000e\000s\000 \000c\000o\000m\000m\000a\000 \0000\000\)\000\r "\000\011\000F\000o\000r\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000s\000e\000c\000o\000n\000d\000 \000l\000i\000n\000e\000 \000i\000n\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000s\000y\000s\000t\000e\000m\000:\000\r "\000\011\000T\000h\000e\000 \000l\000i\000n\000e\000 \000s\000l\000a\000n\000t\000s\000 \000g\000r\000a\000d\000u\000a\000l\000l\000y\000 \000u\000p\000 \000f\000r\000o\000m\000 \000l\000e\000f\000t\000 \000t\000o\000 \000r\000i\000g\000h\000t\000.\000\r "\000\011\000T\000h\000e\000 \000l\000i\000n\000e\000 \000p\000a\000s\000s\000e\000s\000 \000t\000h\000r\000o\000u\000g\000h\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000f\000o\000l\000l\000o\000w\000i\000n\000g\000 \000p\000o\000i\000n\000t\000s\000:\000\r "\000\011\000\(\000n\000e\000g\000a\000t\000i\000v\000e\000 \0003\000 \000c\000o\000m\000m\000a\000 \0000\000\)\000\r "\000\011\000\(\0000\000 \000c\000o\000m\000m\000a\000 \0003\000\)\000\r "\000\011\000F\000o\000r\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000p\000a\000r\000a\000b\000o\000l\000a\000 \000i\000n\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000s\000y\000s\000t\000e\000m\000:\000\r "\000\011\000T\000h\000e\000 \000p\000a\000r\000a\000b\000o\000l\000a\000 \000o\000p\000e\000n\000s\000 \000d\000o\000w\000n\000w\000a\000r\000d\000.\000\r "\000\011\000T\000h\000e\000 \000v\000e\000r\000t\000e\000x\000 \000i\000s\000 \000a\000t\000 \000p\000o\000i\000n\000t\000 \000\(\000n\000e\000g\000a\000t\000i\000v\000e\000 \000f\000i\000v\000e\000 \000f\000o\000u\000r\000t\000h\000s\000 \000c\000o\000m\000m\000a\000 \000S\000t\000a\000r\000t\000F\000r\000a\000c\000t\000i\000o\000n\000 \0004\0009\000 \000O\000v\000e\000r\000 \0008\000 \000E\000n\000d\000F\000r\000a\000c\000t\000i\000o\000n\000\)\000.\000\r "\000\011\000T\000h\000e\000 \000p\000a\000r\000a\000b\000o\000l\000a\000 \000p\000a\000s\000s\000e\000s\000 \000t\000h\000r\000o\000u\000g\000h\000 \000t\000h\000e\000 \000f\000o\000l\000l\000o\000w\000i\000n\000g\000 \000p\000o\000i\000n\000t\000s\000:\000\r "\000\011\000\(\000n\000e\000g\000a\000t\000i\000v\000e\000 \0003\000 \000c\000o\000m\000m\000a\000 \0000\000\)\000\r "\000\011\000\(\000n\000e\000g\000a\000t\000i\000v\000e\000 \000f\000i\000v\000e\000 \000f\000o\000u\000r\000t\000h\000s\000 \000c\000o\000m\000m\000a\000 \000S\000t\000a\000r\000t\000F